#: ../../source/docs/common-ltm-telemetry.rst:11
#: b2758cf23450453aa80a8a511b82941f
msgid ""
"Lightweight TeleMetry protocol (LTM) is one-way communication protocol - "
"data downlink from vehicle - that allows you to send most important vehicle "
"data at low band-width / low baud rate, usually at 2400 bauds."
msgstr ""
"轻量级数传协议（LTM）是一种单向通信协议——来自飞行器的数据下行链路——允许以低带宽/低波特率（通常 2400 波特）发送最重要的飞行器数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ltm-telemetry.rst:13
#: 5e70c11616284b48a5d1524433294f57
msgid "Protocol was introduced by KipK and is used in his Ghetto Station."
msgstr "该协议由 KipK 发明，并用于其 Ghetto Station。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ltm-telemetry.rst:15
#: 5a3bff06ef4f4aa29cad8fe87b144a5b
msgid ""
"Typical use-case is antenna tracking when serial telemetry data from Flight "
"Controller (FC) are transformed by Frequency Shift Keying modulation (FSK) "
"modem to sort of audio signal, that is transferred by audio channel of video"
" transmitter to video receiver on ground side. Consequently it's converted "
"back to digital signal by other FSK modem and processed in antenna tracker "
"(AT) and possibly in Ground Control Station (GCS)."
msgstr ""
"典型使用场景是天线追踪，飞控（FC）的串行数传数据通过频移键控调制（FSK）调制解调器转换为一种音频信号，通过图传的音频通道传输到地面端的图像接收机。随后，另一台"
" FSK 调制解调器将其转换回数字信号，在天线追踪器（AT）以及可能的地面站（GCS）中进行处理。"

