msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ltm-telemetry.rst:47
#: d07fdd12082f48f6b58f910f578a3620
msgid ""
"Parameter **SERIALX_PROTOCOL** has to be set to value *25* to enable LTM "
"output from FC on given serial port. Note that only one LTM output port is "
"supported. If you set multiple serial ports to output LTM, only the first "
"one found during serial driver initialisation will actually be assigned to "
"output LTM telemetry."
msgstr ""
"参数 **SERIALX_PROTOCOL** 需设置为 *25* 以在指定串口上启用飞控的 LTM 输出。注意只支持一个 LTM "
"输出端口。如果将多个串口设置为输出 LTM，则只有串口驱动初始化时找到的第一个会被实际分配用于输出 LTM 数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ltm-telemetry.rst:53
#: 5be044da828843149fb34cf318ac81f5
msgid "LTM configuration screenshot from Mission Planner"
msgstr "Mission Planner 中 LTM 配置截图"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ltm-telemetry.rst:57
#: a3d3e6def3754c6181c3393cbc18d6bc
msgid ""
"Don't forget to set your LTM telemetry port's baud rate to an appropriate "
"value. If you are using FSK modems, baud rate value depends on capability of"
" modems."
msgstr "不要忘记将 LTM 数传端口的波特率设置为适当值。如果使用 FSK 调制解调器，波特率取决于调制解调器的能力。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ltm-telemetry.rst:59
#: 0067695068a146c697773dbcfb75a7c8
msgid ""
"Additionally, not all of your autopilot's serial ports support the lowest "
"possible baud rate setting of 1 ( = 1200 baud). On STM32F4xx and F7xx based "
"autopilots, these typically are USARTs 1 and 6 that run on the full system "
"clock. If set to 1200 baud, these ports will default to 19200 baud instead. "
"If you have issues getting correct LTM telemetry output at 1200 baud, try "
"using a serial port other that USART 1 or 6 or opt for 2400 baud instead. On"
" STM32H7-based boards, 2400 baud is lowest supported UART baudrate. Check "
"your flightcontroller's hardware page for further reference on UART to "
"SERIALn mapping."
msgstr ""
"此外，并非所有飞控串口都支持最低可能的波特率设置 1（= 1200 波特）。在基于 STM32F4xx 和 F7xx 的飞控上，运行在全系统时钟上的 "
"USART 1 和 6 通常不支持。如果设置为 1200 波特，这些端口将默认使用 19200 波特。如果在 1200 波特时无法获得正确的 LTM "
"数传输出，请尝试使用 USART 1 或 6 以外的串口，或改用 2400 波特。在基于 STM32H7 的飞控板上，2400 波特是支持的最低 "
"UART 波特率。请查阅您飞控的硬件页面以了解 UART 到 SERIALn 的映射。"

